      "index": 0,
      "text": "Instructions This quiz is timed, you need to complete it within 20 minutes of starting. Keep track of your answers and show your work on paper in your own handwriting. Upload a pdf of your work to Quiz 2B_asy_work in Gradescope within 5 minutes of exiting Proctorio. If your work is uploaded more than 5 minutes after finishing the Proctorio quiz, you will not receive credit. 230fe0ef50798c3b4bce8a805fb8a8582053526"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Warning"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Move To... This element is a more accessible alternative to drag & drop reordering. Press Enter or Space to move this question. Question 1 22.5 / 40 pts Edit this Question Delete this Question 0 essay_question 111175672 <p><img src=\"/courses/2053526/files/118705932/preview\" alt=\"binary stars\"></p> <p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Stars orbit their common center of mass as shown, assume circular orbits.</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A. What is the center of mass of the system, measured from M? Show all work and solve completely symbolically in terms of given variables.</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">B. Find the orbital period of the system. Show all work and solve completely symbolically in terms of given variables.</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">C. What is the total energy of the system? Show all work and solve completely symbolically in terms of given variables.</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">..............................................................................</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Enter your initials in the text box and upload a pdf scan of your work to Quiz2B_asy_work in Gradescope within 5 minutes of exiting Proctorio.</span></p> Stars orbit their common center of mass as shown, assume circular orbits. A. What is the center of mass of the system, measured from M? Show all work and solve completely symbolically in terms of given variables. B. Find the orbital period of the system. Show all work and solve completely symbolically in terms of given variables. C. What is the total energy of the system? Show all work and solve completely symbolically in terms of given variables. .............................................................................. Enter your initials in the text box and upload a pdf scan of your work to Quiz2B_asy_work in Gradescope within 5 minutes of exiting Proctorio. Your Answer: JP"
